    "difficulty": 15,
    "notes": "<h3>Champion | Standard</h3>\n<p><em>A ghostly fighter with spears and swords, anchored by duty.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Move through solid objects, protect, fight</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 15 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 7/15 | <strong>HP:</strong> 4 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +1 | Weapon: Very Close | 2d8+1 physical</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Ancient Knowledge +2</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Ghost - Passive</strong>: The Guardian has resistance to physical damage. Mark a Stress to move up to Close range through solid objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Grave Blade - Action</strong>: Spend a Fear to make an attack against a target within Very Close range. On a success, deal 2d10+6 physical damage and the target must <strong>mark a Stress</strong>.</p>\n",
